# Session 12 Assignments – HTML, CSS & Tailwind CSS Projects

##  Overview
This session focuses on building modern frontend interfaces using **HTML5**, **CSS3**, and **Tailwind CSS**.  
The assignments include multiple mini projects that strengthen layout design, styling, responsiveness, and utility-first CSS development.

This session marks the transition from basic frontend design to modern CSS framework usage.

---

##  Topics Covered
- HTML5 Structure
- CSS3 Styling
- Layout Design
- Responsive UI
- Component Styling
- Utility-first CSS
- Tailwind CSS Setup
- npm Package Management
- Frontend Project Organization

---

