##  How to Run

### Basic HTML/CSS Projects

Open:

```bash
index.html
```

in browser or run using Live Server.

---

### Tailwind Project

Move into folder:

```bash
cd project-4
```

Install dependencies:

```bash
npm install
```

Run Tailwind build:

```bash
npm run dev
```

Open:

```bash
index.html
```

